                                                                                
  Keys  (press any key to close)                                                
                                                                                
  ↑/↓ Enter      move, open or switch to a connection                           
  /              filter the connection list (Esc clears)                        
  Alt+←/→        previous / next tab                                            
  Alt+↑/↓        previous / next open connection                                
  ^B n           new tab for the active connection                              
  ^B w           close tab                                                      
  ^B ←/→  ^B 1-9 switch tab                                                     
  ^B Tab         move focus between list and terminal                           
  ^B [           scroll back (mouse wheel also scrolls)                         
  r / x          on an ended tab: reconnect / close                             
  ^B b           hide or show the connection list                               
  ^B r           refresh connections from ssh_config                            
  ^B ^B          send ^B to the session                                         
  ^B q           quit                                                           
                                                                                
                                                                                
